<title>USA: Vivid Technologies to equip airports.</title>
<headline>Vivid Technologies to equip airports.</headline>
<dateline>WOBURN, Mass 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vivid Technologies Inc said Monday it had received orders from two major Asian airports for systems that detect explosives in passenger baggage.  </p>
<p>Vivid said Malaysia's Kuala Lumpur International Airport and Hong Kong's Chek Lap Kok Airport had bought automated explosives detection equipment worth a combined total of $19 million.</p>
